monster_from:
ZzzCharacter.cpp, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_FOREST_MONSTER:

    OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_FOREST_MONSTER);
    c = CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_FOREST_MONSTER, PositionX, PositionY);
    c->Object.Scale = 0.75f;

That is the whole case. No Weapon, no BlendMesh, no HiddenMesh, no Level - so nothing held, nothing added, nothing hidden and no glowing eyes. 0.75 is the smallest of Noria's monsters, under the Goblin and the Beetle at 0.8.
